# Chicken: 32x32, idle 0-5, walk 6-11, peck 12-17 (best-effort split of an 18-frame row).
# GandalfHardcore pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable on
# its own). The world view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips
# to face the heading. Action rows beyond idle/walk bake for later use.

sheet chicken.ppm
cell 32 32

bank CHICKEN
seq IDLE loop ticks=5 : lin 0-5
seq WALK loop ticks=3 : lin 6-11
seq PECK loop ticks=4 : lin 12-17
